(7551950, 1209426, 186393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> Cold and lonely. IMO the benches take up too much of the image for a landscape. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Mary! I agree about the benches taking up a bit too much space. A wider shot would have also added to the lonely feeling of the image. Unfortunately a wider shot would also have included the trash can and tree right next to the bench on the right.</td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: Cold and lonely. IMO the benches take up too much of the image for a landscape.   Thanks Mary! I agree about the benches taking up a bit too much space. A wider shot would have also added to the lonely feeling of the image. Unfortunately a wider shot would also have included the trash can and tree right next to the bench on the right.', '2018-01-10 00:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
