(7551960, 1209512, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the votes and comments.<br/> <br/>This is the iconic Yosemite Falls taken from Cooks Meadow in Spring 2011. I was very lucky to experience snowfall this late in the year.  I was the only person around at dawn to capture the first light of day and the morning mist. <br/> <br/>This is not the strongest composition but with such beauty it was hard to get a bad shot. It was incredibly peaceful with just the occasional distant thunder-crack of ice falling to break the silence. <br/> <br/>I wrote a brief blog post related to my morning in Yosemite with other photographs taken at the time. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.mostly.photos/blog/2016/11/5/one-rainy-day-in-california" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">One Rainy Day in California</a></td>', 'Thank you all for the votes and comments. This is the iconic Yosemite Falls taken from Cooks Meadow in Spring 2011. I was very lucky to experience snowfall this late in the year.  I was the only person around at dawn to capture the first light of day and the morning mist.  This is not the strongest composition but with such beauty it was hard to get a bad shot. It was incredibly peaceful with just the occasional distant thunder-crack of ice falling to break the silence.  I wrote a brief blog post related to my morning in Yosemite with other photographs taken at the time.  One Rainy Day in California', '2018-01-10 04:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
