(7552031, 1209512, 19959, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sgeorge41362:</b></div><hr/><i> I have never been. Is this spot easily accessible? Or do you need to hike out to it? <br/> <br/>Gorgeous capture!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Very easy to access. There is off-road parking literally minutes walk away from Cooks Meadow... Yosemite Valley is a very accessible location for some beautiful scenery... go, just go :)</td>', 'Originally posted by sgeorge41362: I have never been. Is this spot easily accessible? Or do you need to hike out to it?  Gorgeous capture!!   Very easy to access. There is off-road parking literally minutes walk away from Cooks Meadow... Yosemite Valley is a very accessible location for some beautiful scenery... go, just go :)', '2018-01-10 16:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
